{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17615","headline":"燕居 · 羊士谔","name":"燕居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋斋膏沐暇，旭日照轩墀。\n露重芭蕉叶，香凝橘柚枝。\n简书随吏散，宝骑与僧期。\n报国得何力，流年已觉衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17615.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17615","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}